        "title": "業務邏輯",
        "details": "/// <summary>\n/// 是否為外國人\n/// </summary>\n/// <param name=\"custId\"></param>\n/// <returns></returns>\npublic static bool IsForeignerCustId( string custId )\n{\nstring userId = custId.PadRight( 10 , ' ' ).Substring( 0 , 10 );\nif ( Regex.IsMatch( userId , @\"^[A-Z]{2}\\d{8}$\" ) )\n{\nreturn true;\n}\nelse if ( Regex.IsMatch( userId , @\"^\\d{8}[A-Z]{2}$\" ) )\n{\nreturn true;\n}\n//202001150072 外來人口新式統一證號\nelse if (Regex.IsMatch(userId, @\"^[A-Z][89]\\d{8}$\"))\n{\nreturn true;\n}"
      }
    ],
